WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.861
Every study machine is on the Study page.

2
00:00:03.861 --> 00:00:06.807
Type what you are studying…

3
00:00:06.807 --> 00:00:10.244
…or tap your subject.

4
00:00:10.244 --> 00:00:15.448
Then open a machine.

5
00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:19.673
Every machine works the same way: the How it works bar shows the four steps.

6
00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:23.276
1 Pick a topic. 2 Change the controls. 3 Read the notes. 4 Test yourself.

7
00:00:23.276 --> 00:00:26.855
Tap Watch how on any machine for its own short video.

8
00:00:26.855 --> 00:00:30.840
Stuck anywhere? Ask Allen. He can see the machine and help.
